---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Project terms | Plumba"
  description="Project availability, source code, and information about the Plumba website."
>
  <section class="legal-page container">
    <header class="legal-heading">
      <h1>Project terms</h1>
      <p>What to know while Plumba takes shape.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Project status</h2>
      <p>
        Plumba is in active development. This website explains the direction of
        the project and the workflow being built. It does not announce a release
        date or confirm that every described capability is available today.
      </p>
      <h2>Using the software</h2>
      <p>
        Check the{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/theobiabo/plumba">Plumba repository</a>
        for the source code, current development status, and any applicable
        license terms before using the software. This page does not replace the
        terms that apply to the code.
      </p>
      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        Browsing this website does not create an account, enroll a machine, or
        deploy a blockchain node. There are no purchases or financial
        transactions on this website.
      </p>
      <h2>External resources</h2>
      <p>
        Links to other websites provide additional project information. Those
        websites maintain their own content and terms.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/">
        Back to Plumba
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
